; Generated by tools/split_effects.py from data/effects.lasm.
; Audited locally: all three selected cards remain in the resolution collection.
; Send both non-monsters after a successful monster summon; otherwise send all three.
; Candidate selection is without replacement, and position is chosen before summoning.
; Monster eligibility uses #223; FREE_MONSTER_SLOT (#7) is an address or immediate zero.
; Native SUMMON layout: position=8, face_up=4, defense_position=9, controller=79.
; These fixes are local to this card file, not the combined generator output.
; Each .program retains its original PCs, registers and labels.

; Chosen One: effect 1 (ACTIVATION, optional=0)
.program 21888494_1
PC Instruction Meaning
    0 SELECT A2, [0:2:0]                                                          
    1 SELECT A3, [0:0]                                                            
    2 COMPARE F0, V0, #0, EQUAL                                                   
    3 JUMPIF F0, 6                                                                
    4 SELECT A2, [1:2:0]                                                          
    5 SELECT A3, [1:0]                                                            
    6 ENUMERATE V2, A2                                                            
